# Paths are relative to $HOME, not to this directory — chezmoi resolves nested
# ignore files against the destination root.
#
# Whitelist, not blocklist: Claude Code adds runtime directories every release,
# so ignoring everything unlisted is the only form that survives an upgrade.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/agents
!.claude/hooks
!.claude/skills
